<description>&lt;p&gt;Bomb blasts near the Colombia-Venezuela border have wounded at least four police officers, including a device near Cúcuta's main bridge. Former Cúcuta security chief Miguel Castellanos was shot dead in a political assassination. An extortion-linked assault in Colombia killed at least six people. The conflict recorded 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPXzltNHNESkNqU1BZSWY2SWxiSmlPLXV3cHVmZEZlTVU3a3kwRXZteE9LQ0JLNmo4WFRELVZremxreFRyaWpUcW9FNnRkenpqUWdVZld0Y0swdVRwYjJ5OER3Uk1tSTlXaUFMOVpkOC1UZlpkZDFtMWJrMGl3ZzhXdy1lYkRZeDF6MHN0eE50bmRZM2RiOTZ0ZDdB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Jamaica Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPWm1KbXZzWU9pendiZ1RqZ19mLTl2UTNSZS10WGVHQVJNTkRtNUhqNThVbWZ2djZfRDRVZjFaRmJ5TVEtbm9VdVZXenBVb1NLWWt5ZVQ5S2h3ZC1NQzc5V2xpdW9yOEtoMkJITXRmZ1pCYVI3c2hONkdfWGNNaE51b2x0OUVUdGljNWtBaE5jTVdNaG14LWhYZnBWdDNJbmstWDRqaXJSeXVhRWY5YU5DcDNwYTBMczRB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Tampa Free Press&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;New Castle News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxPelBXTVNSek9nX0JDdmJOTG1tLXc4elAzY2FuTjU2NDJvX09Ea1pLZFRWdlVqVEE0T1NnMng0cjNVeEVQUkdweVJyOGNfTEYyUU43eHM0X3dqVUhkVVRhQkZfZ2tsVXB3RFpTcWQ0SEJRc3FvR3pxT0xaR004dU9tNjVtQ01kQ09EczFSVXZEQnZxOUU3Z2hoS0ttU1RiaTVaMEdVQVBvSVpDeEVHc013?oc=5&quot;&gt;DVIDS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxQUS14YnE1YWlfUXpwNW5oVjRKbTVGR0ZOZmQ2eWZjRlhibG93MlV2SWhuQVQtc253OWNpeDFBRkdJRlpmZTMzOFZoeEo2cXVrMTVXZ3lOckZ0SHZqZ2I1cG1TM0tWRmVxYkJPcUc4SWhCNm1nci1yVV9WbDFsV09CYzZ0UC10OVBlSmFoa2J2bEg3OTFCcGc0N2ozdTJOZlpsZ2xB?oc=5&quot;&gt;ColombiaOne.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxONC1VSEtfUzl